  "description": "SkyWebFramework.Utilities is an all-in-one helper library that eliminates boilerplate code and provides battle-tested static helpers and extension methods for common .NET operations across .NET 6.0, 7.0, 8.0, and 9.0. Includes EasyString, EasyDate, EasySecurity, EasyCollection, EasyMath, EasyObject, EasyJson, EasyEnum, EasyAsync, and EasyValidation with zero external runtime dependencies.",
